&lt;b&gt;How it works:&lt;/b&gt;
• The app 'touches' a trigger file inside its sandbox.
• Your host system detects this change and runs the refresh command.
• You can inspect the exact command inside &lt;b&gt;gnome-refresher.service&lt;/b&gt;.

